{"id":"n72803-1-9","stage":5,"title":"일몰 · 日落","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72803-1-9-1","ko":"오늘은 일몰 전에 퇴근할게요.","zh":"今天我会在日落前下班。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일몰","meaning":"日落","explanation":"일몰：日落","readings":[{"term":"일몰","audio":"/audio/fe7018235174780da626.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72803","senseId":"1","lemma":"일몰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전에","meaning":"上","explanation":"전：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17306","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"퇴근할게요.","meaning":"下班","explanation":"퇴근하다：下班；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"퇴근하다","audio":"/audio/b94b2beefd0df40e1642.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82103","senseId":"1","lemma":"퇴근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"fe7018235174780d","term":"일몰","zh":"日落","audio":"/audio/fe7018235174780da626.mp3","entryId":"72803","definition":"太阳落下。","pronunciation":["일몰"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17306","definition":"时间上之前的。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"b94b2beefd0df40e","term":"퇴근하다","zh":"下班","audio":"/audio/b94b2beefd0df40e1642.mp3","entryId":"82103","definition":"做完岗位上的工作，返回家里。","pronunciation":["퇴ː근하다","퉤ː근하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dbd3fe829658e4cef34e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72803-1-9-2","ko":"매일같이 한밤중에 집에 들어오는 당신이 웬일이에요?","zh":"你平时总是半夜才回家，今天怎么不一样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"매일같이","meaning":"天天，每日","explanation":"매일：天天，每日；같이：表示“像……一样”；在时间词后也可强调该时间。","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58104","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한밤중에","meaning":"深夜，午夜，大半夜，大晚上，深更半夜","explanation":"한밤중：深夜，午夜，大半夜，大晚上，深更半夜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한밤중","audio":"/audio/8526619eaddea12eaa8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84904","senseId":"1","lemma":"한밤중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어오는","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당신이","meaning":"您","explanation":"당신：您；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"당신","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30200","senseId":"5","lemma":"당신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웬일이에요?","meaning":"什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么","explanation":"웬일：什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"웬일","audio":"/audio/9641672a10627d984dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69528","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"天天，每日","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58104","definition":"每天都，无遗漏地。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"8526619eaddea12e","term":"한밤중","zh":"深夜，午夜，大半夜，大晚上，深更半夜","audio":"/audio/8526619eaddea12eaa8a.mp3","entryId":"84904","definition":"很深的夜。","pronunciation":["한밤쭝"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]},{"id":"348eb0b3d01dfc54","term":"당신","zh":"您","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3","entryId":"30200","definition":"(敬语)指代听话人。","pronunciation":["당신"]},{"id":"9641672a10627d98","term":"웬일","zh":"什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么","audio":"/audio/9641672a10627d984dbd.mp3","entryId":"69528","definition":"怎么回事；或指什么样的事。","pronunciation":["웬ː닐"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec3355a644b1ed4f039e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72803","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你平时总是半夜才回家，今天怎么不一样了？","今天我会在日落前下班。","这杯鸡尾酒很棒。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天我会在日落前下班。","这杯鸡尾酒很棒。","你平时总是半夜才回家，今天怎么不一样了？"],"answer":2}]}
